# Leftovers deployment

- **Live app URL:** https://frendofamily.netlify.app
- **GitHub repo:** https://github.com/kellyfrendo/Leftovers
- When referring to the deployed/production app, testing on iPad, or Netlify deploys, use **frendofamily.netlify.app** — not leftovers.netlify.app or other guessed URLs.
- Local development: `python3 -m http.server 8080` at http://localhost:8080 (cloud sync requires Netlify or `netlify dev`).
